        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo Stainless Steel 4 x 16 Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size 4\" x 16\" commercial door push plate . Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, factories and stores. Made in the USA from .050\" thick solid stainless steel. Your choice of <b>Brushed stainless steel</b> or bright <b>Polished stainless steel</b> finish. Packaged with mounting hardware for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-71_size.gif?v=1704354625\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 71 Push Plate\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-4-x-16-pull-plate-don-jo-7131-630\"><b>4\" x 16\" Pull Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 71 Stainless Steel Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  Optional <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b> or <b>Polished Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/71.pdf?v=1704262268\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 71 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> \r\n</p>",
